# Lux2ISO Phase 3 - Mechanical-Switch Build BOM

This is the electronics BOM for one unit built using the [from-scratch wiring manual](Phase3-Wiring-Manual.md). It replaces the previous Phase 3 shopping list.

Design: internal-8-MHz ATmega328P, one encoder, 128x32 OLED, BH1750 module, EG1218 slide switch, and USB-C charging at 100 mA. Charge only with the meter switched OFF.

Manufacturer part numbers below are the purchasing authority. DigiKey catalog links were researched on 2026-11-12; live prices and stock were not reliably accessible. Do not substitute parts without checking pinout, electrical ratings, and footprint.

